  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "節慶之事件行銷",
    "sub_ename": "THE EVENT MARKETING OF FESTIVALS",
    "describe_ch": "節慶（ Festival ）在辭典裡頭有著節日慶典的意思，對東方而言，代表著紀念或團圓之意，如端午節、中秋節等；對西方而言，帶著歡樂、慶祝之意，如萬聖節、嘉年華等。在多重文化的台灣，不論是東方或西方節慶，早已廣泛成為商業應用，甚至衍生或創造出許多新的節慶行銷活動。所謂節慶行銷，廣義上算是促銷活動的一種，藉由某個節慶主題，配合廣宣活動，以達到吸引人潮與創造業績的目的。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to deliver the concept of the triditional meanings, the activities of the festival in Taiwan, and in other countries. In addition, it also aims to explore the marketing operation and business models of success cases behind different cultural and social conditions in differenct countries.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
